From 65cb32eeec8a245270817bbad8ed133eb5432952 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: max994-dev <bmax994@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 01:40:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] Repair 19 broker scripts against the 2026-10-04 opt-out
 page captures

capture_forms.py run on the VPS gave the real HTML of the 22 brokers that
crashed most between 24 Sep and 2 Oct (1,200+ crashes, 0 successes). Each
script now matches what the site actually serves:

  accudatacom       privacy.deepsync.com rebuilt its form (new ids, radio, checkboxes)
  archivescom       single OSM-autocomplete address box + hidden field
  completemedical   human checkbox gone, honeypots, Remove radio, optional signature step
  fmadatacom        reCAPTCHA -> hCaptcha
  demystcom         captcha mounts after first Submit; the old refresh unmounted it
  acxiomcom         form moved to omnicom-privacy.my.onetrust.com; Country gates State; phone required
  affinitysolutions Country gates State; DOB removed; reCAPTCHA -> BotDetect image captcha
  beenverified/bumper native selects replace the MUI modal; age field; guest account type
  faradayio         Google Forms date = _year/_month/_day sub-fields (was HTTP 400)
  contactoutcom     e-mail + Turnstile + verification link
  americaphonebook  reverse-search the number, click Remove (contact form is gone)
  brandwatchcom     DPOrganizer portal dead -> CCPA e-mail to privacy@brandwatch.com (their documented route)
  alescodatacom     page 404 -> CCPA e-mail to privacy@alescodata.com (their documented route)
  arrests family    *courtrecords.us fall back to courtrecords.us/optout/ (I Agree gate);
                    ohioarrests contact form lives at /corrections
  dead (step 4)     advancedpeoplesearchcom (parked), findpeoplesearchcom (ad page),
                    acbjcom (OneTrust form removed; site blocks fetches)

lib/broker_helpers: select_onetrust_country/autocomplete, solve_image_captcha_element,
set_turnstile_response, wait_text. capture_forms.py gains a round2 target list for the
pages Cloudflare hides from the web server (allpeople /removal,
advancedbackgroundchecks /opt-out, alesco HubSpot form, brandwatch DSAR form, acbj).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
